From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Ericson <John.Ericson@Obsidian.Systems>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 02:20:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] tools/libcompat: <sys/avl.h> needs <sys/avl_impl.h>

Another dependency the header list does not state, found the same way the auxv
one is documented: the build says so.

    include/sys/avl.h:38:10: fatal error: sys/avl_impl.h: No such file or directory

Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5 (claude-opus-5)
---
 usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile b/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
index e30cb7b6b5..030881591b 100644
--- a/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
+++ b/usr/src/tools/libcompat/Makefile
@@ -78,6 +78,7 @@ SYSHDRS=	sys/elf.h \
 		sys/auxv_386.h \
 		sys/auxv_SPARC.h \
 		sys/avl.h \
+		sys/avl_impl.h \
 		sys/link.h \
 		sys/machelf.h
 
